</style><p>Voici les cartes de hauteur utilisées pour les fenêtres, la peinture blanche et les tuiles du toit.</p><div class="figure-grid"><figure id="figure-shutter-trim"><a href="#files"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="window and stairs" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption>window and stairs</figcaption></figure><figure id="figure-white-paint"><a href="#files"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="white painting for the main wood parts" loading="lazy"></a><figcaption>white painting for the main wood parts</figcaption></figure><figure id="figure-roof-height"><a href="#files"><img src="data:image/png;base64,